// Bundled catalogs for quick-fill dropdowns in the Defaults panel.
//
// This is deliberately just plain data — no admin UI, no server. To add,
// edit, or retire an entry, edit this file, commit, and push; GitHub Pages
// picks it up on the next deploy. Selecting a preset only pre-fills fields;
// every field stays freely editable afterwards, so a slightly-wrong preset
// never blocks you.

// One entry per site — Company and Location are set together since every
// site in this org is its own Company *and* its own Location (matching the
// original import templates, where those two columns were always
// identical). If a site's Location ever needs to differ from its Company
// name, add a `location` field to that entry to override it.
//
// `shortCode` drives Asset Tag: every asset's Asset Tag is generated as
// `${shortCode}-${serial number}` (e.g. "SCL-MMLY7EE05514019418851M"),
// never typed by hand. Fill these in below as you get the real list — a
// site with no shortCode yet just leaves Asset Tag blank for you to fill
// in manually until then.
